  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "64",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 64"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "64",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, naki otari gotandora igoro oike gocha inse aa, erinde ebitunwa bitengechigwe ase obosio bwao?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo yarenge koba buna omorero ogosamba chinsagia chi’emete, naende buna omorero okoberia amaache, na igo ogere erieta riao rimanyekane ase ababisa bao, na abanto b’ebisaku batengechigwe ase obosio bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo gwakorete amang’ana ’ogokumia totakagerete ng’a nabe, ogaacha inse aa, na ebitunwa bigatengechigwa ase obosio bwao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa amatuko a kare onde tana koigwa nogoto kwaye, gose korora neriso riaye, Nyasae onga buna aye ogokorera abwo bagosemeretie amaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye nigo okorotota abwo bagokora ay’oboronge bare nomogooko, abwo bagokoinyora bare ase chinchera chiao. Rora, aye nigo kwagechetigwe, ekero twakorete ebibe; twabeire tore ase ebibe biaito ase engakientambe. Inee! Ntonyare gotooreka?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Intwe twensi twabeire buna abatachenegeti; oboronge bwaito bwonsi nigo bore buna eanga ere ne riko. Nigo togosusana buna rito, na ebibe biaito nigo bigotoira aare buna omwaga okoira amato amomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Monto onde tari okorangeria erieta riao akonywe, onde tari ogotaboboka akobwate bokong’u; aye kwabisire obosio bwao titoborora, na igo gwatigire ebibe biaito bigotokoora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nonya naboigo, aye Omonene, naye Tata oito; intwe nigo tore esike, naye omokori chinyongo. Intwe twensi nigo tore emeremo y’amaboko ao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, toba nendamwamu enene mono, togenderera koinyora ebibe biaito botambe. Torigererie, otoinyore, twensi nigo tore abanto bao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emechie yao emechenu yasarigwe yabeire orosana, na Sayoni obeire erooro, na Yerusalemu obeire bosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyomba yaito enchenu naende engiya mono, agwo ase chisokoro chiaito chiasoete ime kogotogia, bono yasambirwe nomorero; aase aito onsi arenge akogokia abeire amaturi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 64:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye Omonene, Inee, nigo ogochia gwetanga torora amang’ana aya? Inee! Nigo ogochia gokira‐kiri na gotochanda mono?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.64.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.64.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
